title: "The Bushido Codex"
abstract: >-
  A conduct codex for autonomous AI coding agents, skinned as the warrior's
  code — four disciplines (Rei, Gi, Makoto, Chugi), each rule carrying an
  observable falsifier. Part of a small family of conduct harnesses.
